> @Danil-Grigorev while volume is being provisioned, new node was being added to the k8s cluster. Asking this to understand the case when this is happening. I am trying to figure out why we received nil `nodeInfo` from the nodeInfoMap in `getRefreshedNodeInfo()`

@divyenpatel It happens after the `kube-controller-manager` pod is restarted. Particulary in this case, there is a deadlock between initial `Node` object processing, and the `vsphere-credentials` `Secret`. Both of them had to be reconciled for newly established informers, and locked on the same resource.

At the same time `PV` creation is handled from `kcm`, and is using the same methods as the rest of the plugin. It is blocked on previous deadlock already.
